### 22. [204 No Content] PUT: Actualizar socio existente (ID 6)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/socios/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombreCompleto": "Andrea Milagros Gómez Huamán",
  "dni": "75849302",
  "telefono": "991122334",
