### 24. [204 No Content] DELETE: Eliminar socio existente (ID 6)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/socios/6
Accept: application/json

### 25. [404 Not Found] DELETE: Eliminar socio inexistente
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/socios/999
Accept: application/json
